@startuml
title US-05: Approve or Reject Borrow Request
skinparam style strictuml
autonumber

actor Lender
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database DB

Lender -> Frontend : Approve or reject request
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/requests/{id}/approve or /reject
Backend -> DB : Fetch BorrowRequest & Item
DB --> Backend : Request & Item details

alt Not owner
    Backend --> Frontend : 403 Forbidden
    Frontend --> Lender : Access denied
else Request not PENDING
    Backend --> Frontend : 409 Conflict
    Frontend --> Lender : Invalid state transition
else Valid transition
    alt Approve
        Backend -> DB : Request -> ACCEPTED, Item -> RESERVED
    else Reject
        Backend -> DB : Request -> REJECTED, Item stays AVAILABLE
    end
    DB --> Backend : Committed
    Backend --> Frontend : 200 OK
    Frontend --> Lender : Show updated status
end
@enduml
